{"unit_id":"Gumiho12345__dsh-plugin-net-access#card-zh","repo":"Gumiho12345/dsh-plugin-net-access","commit":"bbd0458b79f0342587750686dfa35a2f65ccb541","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-net-access 为 Windows DSH Web 客户端增加 Net Access 权限模式。它将新模式接入权限预设和沙箱 runner，在保留 workspace-write 写入范围的同时，把 OpenSSL curl 工具目录加入 PATH，并设置可用的 CA 证书路径。用户可在权限选择器中启用该模式，通过 curl.exe 访问 HTTPS。适合需要在受限写入环境中联网的 Windows DSH 用户。PowerShell 安装脚本会补丁修改 DSH 引擎并下载工具箱；无需 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/cordis.patch.yml:10-24","patches/dsh-permission-presets/lib/index.js:93-98","patches/dsh-sandbox-windows-acl/lib/runner.js:116-130","setup.ps1:14-16","setup.ps1:32-65"]}
